title: "AmbuRoute: traffic- and capacity-aware ambulance hospital selection"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kushal-Raj-G-S/AMBUROUTE"
abstract: >-
  A simulator, equilibrium and learned dispatch policies, and a service with a dispatcher console for choosing
  hospitals for ambulances using calibrated travel times, published bed counts and ambulances already on the road.
authors:
  - name: "AmbuRoute contributors"
keywords:
  - ambulance dispatch
  - hospital selection
  - congestion game
  - reinforcement learning
